i-project solution and couldn't get my project to build and saw that there was an open pull request at #98807 and since it's been about 3 months now, I decided to continue the work on it a little myself. I've updated the FindSolutionFileWithAssemblyName method to make use of the [Microsoft.VisualStudio.SolutionPersistence](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.VisualStudio.SolutionPersistence) package, which has support for both the `.sln` and the new `.slnx` format. This pull request does enable loading slnx formats, and I've been able to build a few test projects successfully using the format, though there may be other areas that need updating to properly add support for them. \r\n\r\nAs with the previous pull request, this also enables building multi-project solutions. I've also gone through the changes requested to the previous pull request and tried to implement those here. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"n